# ADR-019 verification obligation: multiple writes to one architectural register around
# a mispredicted branch; sRAT and free list must recover with no leak or double free.
# 64 iterations allocate several hundred physical registers from a 48-entry PRF, so a
# leak deadlocks rename and a double free corrupts x5.
@name ooo-rename-checkpoint-recovery
@verifies propPhysRegConservation propCheckpointRestoreExact funcBranchRecoveryRestore funcBranchCheckpoint
@verifies funcRenameMap funcFreeListAllocate funcRetirementMapUpdate funcRobTagAllocate propRobTagConsecutive
@verifies propCheckpointReleasedOnce funcBusyTable funcAllocateAtomic funcRobAllocate funcRobComplete funcRobHeadOffer propRobRetireInOrder
@verifies funcCommitHead propCommitInOrder funcRsWakeup funcSelectOldestReady propRsIssueOnlyReady
@verifies funcPublishArbitrate funcPublishFanout propSingleDrain funcReadAtSelect propRobCompletionTargetsLive
@maxcycles 20000
li x5, 0
li x6, 0
li x8, 64
loop: addi x5, x5, 1
addi x5, x5, 2
andi x7, x6, 1
beq x7, x0, even
addi x5, x5, 100
addi x5, x5, -100
even: addi x5, x5, -2
addi x6, x6, 1
bne x6, x8, loop
check x5 == 64
check x6 == 64
